<fn-group>
  <fn id="fn1">
    <label>1</label><p>Note that
    <monospace>sandwich::vcovBS()</monospace> supports a basic form of
    the fractional weighted bootstrap but does not support different
    distributions of weights or other options provided by
    <monospace>fwb</monospace>.</p>
  </fn>
